{"id":"01a04450-6c61-756e-ae2e-33de4ec35903","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.11.1.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.11.1.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: ed25519 pubkey → 200::/7 address\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:42:23.847632Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:41:24.509618Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:41:24.509618Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:46:24.509618Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:41:24.509618Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.11.1.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.11.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:42:25.128291Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Closed against the superseding native-address requirement, not the stale title: current spec/04-network.md sec 6.2 and spec/06-security.md sec 8.5 require exact 0200::/8 bytes (addr[0]=0x02), SHA-512(pubkey) routing bytes, and the same U/L-cleared IID in addr[8:16]. Zephyr lichen_identity_ygg_addr_from_ed25519()/lichen_yggdrasil_addr implements that requirement; no obsolete generic 200::/7 acceptance was introduced. Evidence: host C/UBSan pubkey_to_iid CTest 1/1; Python canonical/shared vector tests 22/22; Rust lichen-core ipv6_address_vectors + yggdrasil_addr_vectors 7/7, including \\u003e=10 native cases and documented divergence from upstream yggdrasil-go AddrForKey. No files changed for this bead.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T17:41:56.449357Z"}
